# Sources/ Logos & Objective-C

- Match existing patterns in `uYouPlus.xm`, `uYouPlusSettings.xm`, and related controllers.
- Use `#import` / project headers consistently (`uYouPlus.h`, `SettingsKeys.h`, etc.).
- Prefer feature flags via existing settings keys rather than hard-coding behavior.
- When adding a setting: wire key → localization string → settings controller UI → hook gated by the key.
- Avoid breaking sideload (jailed) paths; many hooks must tolerate missing jailbreak APIs.
